WEBVTT

00:00:01.552 --> 00:00:06.383
KING QUINCY: And the Trolls
never lived in harmony again.

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:10.866
So the Trolls live in isolation
because of what Pop did?

00:00:10.909 --> 00:00:13.912
Pop tried to destroy our music.

00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:16.611
Just like Barb is trying to do.

00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:18.004
I can make it right.

00:00:18.047 --> 00:00:19.918
History's just gonna
keep repeating itself

00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:22.747
until we make everyone realize
that we're all the same.

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:24.749
But we're not all the same.

00:00:24.793 --> 00:00:26.882
It's why all our strings
are different.

00:00:26.925 --> 00:00:29.276
Because they reflect
our different music.

00:00:29.319 --> 00:00:32.018
Denying our differences

00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:35.108
is denying the truth
of who we are.

00:00:36.979 --> 00:00:39.286
I hadn't thought of it
like that.

00:00:39.329 --> 00:00:42.071
-[alarm wailing]
-[gasps]

00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.334
Rock has arrived!
It's on!

00:00:45.205 --> 00:00:46.423
Prepare for battle!

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:48.686
["Move On Up"
by Curtis Mayfield playing]

00:00:49.513 --> 00:00:51.037
[records scratching]

00:00:55.519 --> 00:00:57.217
[over speaker]:
Assemble the crew.

00:00:59.262 --> 00:01:01.177
♪ Bite your lip

00:01:02.048 --> 00:01:04.833
♪ And take a trip

00:01:06.139 --> 00:01:08.097
♪ Though there may be
wet road ahead ♪

00:01:08.141 --> 00:01:09.925
I'm gonna make sure
you get to safety.

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:11.927
♪ And you cannot slip

00:01:12.754 --> 00:01:14.103
-No. No!
-♪ Move on up

00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:15.583
Let me help you!

00:01:15.626 --> 00:01:17.541
-♪ And keep on...
-[music slows, stops]

00:01:17.585 --> 00:01:18.629
Aw, you kidding me?

00:01:18.673 --> 00:01:20.936
[giggles]

00:01:20.979 --> 00:01:23.895
-Hard Rock cut the power.
-They're fighting dirty.

00:01:23.939 --> 00:01:25.723
-POPPY: Cooper!
-[Trolls clamoring]

00:01:30.989 --> 00:01:32.382
-Hickory.
-HICKORY: Don't worry!

00:01:32.426 --> 00:01:34.384
I'll find you guys.

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:37.039
Uh, Poppy.

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:38.649
-[engines revving]
-[rock music playing]

00:01:38.693 --> 00:01:40.347
BARB:
Rock on!

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:42.131
[Branch whimpering]

00:01:42.175 --> 00:01:44.090
[Poppy grunts]

00:01:48.181 --> 00:01:49.573
No! [grunts]

00:01:49.617 --> 00:01:51.662
We have to get back down there.
There's still hope.

00:01:51.706 --> 00:01:54.012
-We can still fix this.
-Poppy, enough.

00:01:54.056 --> 00:01:55.884
I've listened to you
and I've done it your way,

00:01:55.927 --> 00:01:57.929
and now it's your turn
to listen.

00:01:57.973 --> 00:02:00.018
It's time to get back home.

00:02:00.062 --> 00:02:02.325
I'm not like you.
I can't just give up.

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:03.544
Give up?

00:02:03.587 --> 00:02:05.328
I want to protect
our friends and family.

00:02:05.372 --> 00:02:09.245
I can't go home until I've
proven myself as a good queen.

00:02:09.289 --> 00:02:11.508
So that's what this is
really all about?

00:02:11.552 --> 00:02:12.988
Why are you so upset?

00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:14.642
Because your dad was right

00:02:14.685 --> 00:02:17.166
and Biggie was right
and Queen Essence was right.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:21.170
And I've been backing you up
even when you ignore them.

00:02:23.738 --> 00:02:25.914
But you never listen to me.

00:02:25.957 --> 00:02:28.003
Branch, what are you
talking about?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.788
You want to be a good queen?

00:02:30.832 --> 00:02:32.660
Good queens actually listen.

00:02:32.703 --> 00:02:34.879
You know what I heard
back there?

00:02:34.923 --> 00:02:37.230
Differences do matter.

00:02:39.406 --> 00:02:42.060
Like-like you and me.

00:02:42.104 --> 00:02:44.672
We're too different
to get along.

00:02:44.715 --> 00:02:46.935
Just like all the other Trolls.

00:02:58.425 --> 00:03:00.905
-We arereally different.
-So different.

00:03:00.949 --> 00:03:02.211
-Completely out of harmony.
-Completely.

00:03:02.255 --> 00:03:03.691
I don't even know
why we're friends.

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.041
Neither do I.

00:03:13.614 --> 00:03:15.703
So...

00:03:15.746 --> 00:03:20.142
why do I care about you more
than anybody else in the world?

00:03:23.841 --> 00:03:26.061
Weird, right?

00:03:28.933 --> 00:03:31.153
♪

00:03:37.159 --> 00:03:41.946
♪ I know your favorite song

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:46.821
♪ I hear it every day

00:03:46.864 --> 00:03:51.347
♪ Whoever made your smile

00:03:51.391 --> 00:03:56.613
♪ Made it to get in my way

00:03:56.657 --> 00:04:01.096
♪ And every time you laugh

00:04:01.139 --> 00:04:06.057
♪ You make that little sound

00:04:06.101 --> 00:04:10.410
♪ It's just the hardest thing

00:04:10.453 --> 00:04:15.328
♪ To love you
but not know how ♪

00:04:15.371 --> 00:04:19.245
♪ I hate that you're perfect

00:04:20.202 --> 00:04:24.467
♪ You're perfect for me

00:04:26.643 --> 00:04:28.123
♪ What good are words

00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:34.042
♪ When they always
just get in our way? ♪

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.567
♪ And it hurts the most

00:04:37.611 --> 00:04:43.007
♪ Just to know
that you don't feel the same ♪

00:04:43.051 --> 00:04:44.531
♪ The same

00:04:44.574 --> 00:04:46.533
♪ Yeah

00:04:46.576 --> 00:04:50.319
♪ And I hate
that you're perfect ♪

00:04:50.363 --> 00:04:51.320
[bell dings]

00:04:51.364 --> 00:04:55.106
♪ You're perfect for me

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.456
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah♪

00:04:56.499 --> 00:04:59.937
♪ I hate that you're perfect

00:05:00.982 --> 00:05:06.944
♪ You're perfect for me.

00:05:06.988 --> 00:05:08.119
[quiet laugh nearby]

00:05:08.163 --> 00:05:09.033
BABY BUN [whispers]:
I see you, Branch.

00:05:09.077 --> 00:05:10.383
ARI [singsongy]:
Over here.

00:05:10.426 --> 00:05:11.253
-WANI: There he is.
-GOMDORI: Can you see me?

00:05:11.297 --> 00:05:12.341
-[gasps]
-[laughter]

00:05:12.385 --> 00:05:13.560
-[whistle]
-GOMDORI: I can see you.

00:05:13.603 --> 00:05:14.996
-BABY BUN: Let's get him.
-[laughter]

00:05:15.039 --> 00:05:16.345
WANI:
One, two, three.

00:05:16.389 --> 00:05:17.694
-ALL: Yay!
-[gasps, grunts]

00:05:17.738 --> 00:05:18.826
[yells]:
Oh!

00:05:18.869 --> 00:05:20.349
-[gasps]
-["Russian Roulette" playing]

00:05:20.393 --> 00:05:21.350
WANI:
Hey, crybaby.

00:05:21.394 --> 00:05:23.396
-Your name Poppy?
-[laughter]

00:05:23.439 --> 00:05:25.528
What? No.
Who are you guys?

00:05:25.572 --> 00:05:27.356
-We are the K-Pop Gang.
-[whoops]

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.793
And you're going to take us
to Queen Poppy.

00:05:29.837 --> 00:05:30.794
[chuckles]:
What?

00:05:30.838 --> 00:05:33.057
["Mi Gente" playing]

00:05:34.755 --> 00:05:35.886
[music stops]

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.714
-Not so fast, Tracy.
-[giggles]

00:05:37.758 --> 00:05:38.715
We're taking him.

00:05:38.759 --> 00:05:40.369
It's pronounced "Tresillo."

00:05:40.413 --> 00:05:42.502
-If you want him...
-[reggaeton beat plays]

00:05:42.545 --> 00:05:44.547
-you're going to have
to dance for him. -[laughter]

00:05:44.591 --> 00:05:47.681
I can't live in a world
without reggaeton.

00:05:47.724 --> 00:05:50.510
And we can't live in a world
without K-pop.

00:05:50.553 --> 00:05:52.947
-MALE VOICE: Dance-off!
-[dramatic music plays] -Ooh!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.211
["Russian Roulette" playing,
Trolls singing in Korean]

00:05:58.126 --> 00:05:59.083
♪ Heart-b-b-b-beat

00:05:59.127 --> 00:06:01.347
[singing in Korean]

00:06:03.827 --> 00:06:04.785
♪ Crazy

00:06:04.828 --> 00:06:06.047
[singing in Korean]

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.136
♪ Russian roulette, b-b-beat.

00:06:08.179 --> 00:06:11.139
-["Mi Gente" playing,
singing in Spanish] -[gasps]

